[heading]Version 0.6.0[/heading]

[list]
[*]Added an optional confirmation prompt before traveling, so a misclick no longer moves you (and spends travel-cost items) right away. After picking a destination you get a [b]Travel to X?[/b] screen with Yes/No; No returns to the list.
[*]Configurable with [b]<Confirmation mode="..." />[/b]: [b]off[/b] keeps instant travel, [b]always[/b] always asks, and [b]whenCost[/b] asks only when the trip costs items. The default is [b]whenCost[/b].
[*]Confirmation is a per-player setting, so in multiplayer everyone chooses it from their own config.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
